From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Media: Media Foundation and DXVA in an app container; codecs
 on 32-bit ARM Windows

Hardware video decoding through DXVA on the compositor's device, and the
codec libraries' ARM32 Windows CPU detection and build lists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
